  //
  // S1 (patch 1.1.0.0) trader-loyalty requirements + renames, ported from the
  // s1 branch and re-expressed in the refactor branch's discriminated syntax.
  //
  // 2026-08-15: tarkov.dev ingested most of the S1 batch upstream (renames,
  // trader LL requirements, XP reworks), so the 239 absorbed items were removed
  // from this file (85 whole entries, 154 individual fields). What remains
  // below still diverges from the live API and is load-bearing: 189
  // still-needed corrections, 0 stale (`npm run check-overrides -- --fail-on-stale`).
  //
  // Power of Persuasion / Easy-Breezy / Setup keep only their name and/or
  // traderRequirements here: the PvE variant objectives are already served
  // correctly by the API (the PvP variants live in modes/regular/tasks.json5).
  // Pathfinder keeps its rename and the "Survive and extract on Interchange
  // 7 times" objective rewrite, ported as-is from s1. The Punisher - Part 3
  // and The Huntsman Path - Controller keep their LL4 requirements while the
  // API serves a lower level (6a70899e66497c811decb758 / 6a71c5b3fdd890dfd2f2c34d).
  //
  // Entries below are ACTIVE corrections; `npm run check-overrides` verifies
  // them against the live API.

